{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "さつまいもの日、さつまいろで、さつまいも掘りに行ってきた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobHqNqoK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ピーマンもにんじんもオクラも^^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mob65hxO8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobixEApK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobmI0xE3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前日、いろはが呟いた\n「お芋掘り行きたいな〜｣って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次の日お芋を掘ることとなった\n3人で！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "知らなかったんだけどなんとなんと、\nこの日は「さつまいもの日」だったらしい…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんな偶然あるんだね\n運命だね\nって話しながら\n帰り道には虹がかかってた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして収穫野菜でクッキング🍠🫑🥕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お仕事終わり、集まれたメンバーが次々とやってきて、皆で色んな品を作ったよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobPklFmR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ごちそう🍴"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなで食べると何倍も美味しく感じた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またこういうのみんなでしたいね〜って話しながら\nふざけながら、てれにムーンウォーク教えて貰いながら、\n楽しい一日だったよ"}], "source": "official"}